{"results":[{"url":"https://blox.xyz/projects/vas-pushp-vinod","title":"Vas Pushp Vinod In Borivali West | Buy 2 & 3 BHK in Mumbai","raw_content":"![Blox Logo](/assets/images/blox-logo-white.svg)\n\n![user-primary](/assets/icons/user-primary.svg)\n\n![arrow-down-primary](/assets/icons/arrow-down-primary.svg)\n\nDiscover. Experience. Buy.\n\nGet Personalized experience\n\nby logging in\n\nLogin / Register\n\n[Properties in Mumbai](/buy/mumbai/1a256)\n\n>\n\n[Properties in Borivali West](/buy/mumbai/borivali-west-1a256b7a21)\n\n>\n\nVas Infrastructure\n\n>\n\n![share-primary](/assets/icons/share-primary.svg)\n\n![compare-inactive-secondary](/assets/icons/compare-inactive-secondary.svg)\n\n![heart-primary](/assets/icons/heart-primary.svg)\n\n![Property-Image](https://cdn.blox.xyz/projects-2x/vas-infrastructure-vas-pushp-vinod-elevation-1698908593.webp)\n\n![Property-Image](https://cdn.blox.xyz/projects-2x/vas-infrastructure-vas-pushp-vinod-elevation-1698908593.webp)\n\n![Property-Image](https://cdn.blox.xyz/projects-2x/vas-infrastructure-vas-pushp-vinod-elevation-1698908593.webp)\n\n![Property-Image](https://cdn.blox.xyz/projects-2x/vas-infrastructure-vas-pushp-vinod-elevation-1698908593.webp)\n\n![Property-Image](https://cdn.blox.xyz/projects-2x/vas-infrastructure-vas-pushp-vinod-elevation-1698908593.webp)VIEW ALL\n\n![Propert-Icon](https://cdn.blox.xyz/builders/thumb/021123121604-newproject-2023-11-02t121547339.webp)\n\n# Vas Pushp Vinod\n\nVas Pushp Vinod ,Swami Vivekananda Rd, Borivali West, Mumbai, Maharashtra,400092\n\nBorivali West\n\n₹1.12 Cr - 1.79 Cr\n\n₹1.12 Cr - 1.79 Cr\n\nBOOK PROPERTY\n\n[Price & Floor Plan](#Price & Floor Plan)\n\n![video-primary](/assets/icons/video-primary.svg)\n\n![call-rm](/assets/icons/call-rm.svg)\n\n![calendar-primary](/assets/icons/calendar-primary.svg)\n\nBOOK PROPERTY\n\n## Overview\n\nStep into this stunning home in a sought-after neighbourhood. The grand entrance with high ceilings and natural light leads to an open layout connecting the living, dining, and kitchen areas. A charming breakfast nook overlooks the landscaped backyard. The master bedroom is a spacious retreat with a luxurious bathroom. This property offers a perfect blend of luxury and comfort. Additionally, there are 2 BHK and 3 BHK options available, providing more choices for your living needs.\n\nConfiguration\n\n2 BHK, 3 BHK\n\nReady to move\n\nCompleted in Aug 2023\n\nAvg. Price\n\n₹18,300/sq.ft\n\nRERA Carpet Area\n\n612 - 980 sqft\n\nWhy consider buying this property?\n\n* Immerse in perfection at a prestigious landmark, where luxury is second nature.\n* Elevate your lifestyle with 2 BHK and 3 BHK residences conveniently located near schools, hospitals, and entertainment.\n\n* Experience exclusivity at a futuristic destination with easy access to vital landmarks.\n* Your address is not just a location; it's a gateway to a sophisticated life, seamlessly connected to schools, hospitals, restaurants, banks, and more.\n\n## Google AI Summary\n\n✦\n\nLocation Convenience: Most residents highlight that the project enjoys close proximity to the railway station, local bus depots, markets, schools, and hospitals, making daily commuting and shopping very straightforward. Society Upkeep: The premises generally feature abundant open spaces, clean compounds, well-maintained parks, and dedicated areas for walking or children playing. Construction and Security: Reviews mention robust building quality alongside reliable multi-tier security setups including 24/7 CCTV surveillance and active security guards. Management and Amenities Issues: Multiple reviews flag concerns regarding high monthly maintenance fees coupled with operational lapses like unmaintained swimming pools, faulty car lifts, or restricted power backup.\n\n![up-thumb](/assets/icons/up-thumb.svg)\n\n### The good things\n\nRailway Station Proximity\n\nThe project is situated within easy walking distance of the Borivali railway station and various public transport options.\n\nSecurity Measures\n\nThe society implements 24/7 CCTV monitoring and regular visitor registration protocols at the entrance.\n\nOpen Spaces\n\nThe compound offers extensive green areas, multiple parks, and wide tracks suitable for evening walks.\n\nStructural Integrity\n\nThe apartments showcase good construction design with high-quality plastering and minimal seepage issues.\n\n![down-thumb](/assets/icons/down-thumb.svg)\n\n### Needs improvement\n\nMaintenance Charges\n\nThe monthly society maintenance fees are considered steep compared to the actual facilities delivered on-site.\n\nAmenity Upkeep\n\nSome residents complain about neglected or non-functional amenities like an empty swimming pool and lack of full power backup.\n\nExternal Traffic\n\nThe connecting roads and surrounding junctions experience heavy vehicle congestion, especially during rush hours.\n\nParking Constraints\n\nThe parking arrangements face issues due to frequent malfunctions in the building car lift systems.\n\n---\n\nThe Verdict\n\nGreat for families\n\nStrategic location for rail commuters\n\nExpensive maintenance costs\n\nCompromised amenity management\n\n## Amenities\n\n![amenities/cctv-secondary](/assets/icons/amenities/cctv-secondary.svg)\n\nCCTV / Video Surveillance\n\n![amenities/Entrance-Lobby-secondary](/assets/icons/amenities/Entrance-Lobby-secondary.svg)\n\nEntrance Lobby\n\n![amenities/gym-secondary](/assets/icons/amenities/gym-secondary.svg)\n\nGymnasium\n\n![amenities/indoor-games-secondary](/assets/icons/amenities/indoor-games-secondary.svg)\n\nIndoor Games\n\n![amenities/jogging-secondary](/assets/icons/amenities/jogging-secondary.svg)\n\nJogging / Cycle Track\n\n![amenities/kids-play-areas-secondary](/assets/icons/amenities/kids-play-areas-secondary.svg)\n\nKids Play Areas / Sand Pits\n\n![amenities/Senior-Citizen-Sitout-secondary](/assets/icons/amenities/Senior-Citizen-Sitout-secondary.svg)\n\nSenior citizen Area\n\n![amenities/walking-area-secondary](/assets/icons