128;crop;)\n\n# Vas Pushp Vinod 2 Borivali West, Mumbai\n\n![Vas Pushp Vinod 2 Cover Image](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/project-image/vas-pushp-vinod-2-project-project-large-image1.jpg?aio=w-1140;h-350;crop;)\n\n**₹23,473 Per Sq. Ft Onwards**\n\n₹23,473 Per Sq. Ft.\n\n## Why Invest Through Square Yards?\n\n![Zero brokerage icon](/assets/images/zero-brokerage.svg)\n\n### Zero Brokerage\n\n100% Service, 0% Brokerage\n\n![Lowest price icon](/assets/images/lowest-price.svg)\n\n### Lowest Price Guaranteed\n\nHighly unlikely, but if you find a lower price anywhere, tell us and we will match it.\n\n![Full service support icon](/assets/images/full-service-support.svg)\n\n### Full Service Support\n\nOur sales personnel are accountable for every step.\n\n## About Vas Pushp Vinod 2, Borivali West by Vas Infrastructures\n\n## Vas Pushp Vinod 2 Price List, Price Trends and Market Insights\n\n### Price List\n\nView the latest price list for Vas Pushp Vinod 2.\n\n| Unit Type (Saleable) | Price\\* | Action |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| 1 BHK Apartment  417 Sq. Ft. | **Price on Request** | Check Availability |\n| 2 BHK Apartment  790 Sq. Ft. | **Price on Request** | Check Availability |\n\n\\*Prices are indicative and subject to applicable charges and project terms.\n\n### Price Trends\n\nVas Pushp Vinod 2's average asking price is rising quarter-on-quarter, compared with Borivali West.\n\nSep 2025 — Jun 2026\n\n| Quarter | Vas Pushp Vinod 2 | Borivali West |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| Jun 2026 | 29500 | 30900 |\n| Mar 2026 | 26500 | 31300 |\n| Dec 2025 | 27100 | 30300 |\n| Sep 2025 | 31350 | 30350 |\n\n### Comparable Projects\n\nVas Pushp Vinod 2 avg. price is ₹ 29.5 K/Sq.Ft. compared to Borivali West at ₹ 30.9 K/Sq.Ft.\n\n| Project | Avg. ₹/sq ft |\n| --- | --- |\n| [Shapoorji Pallonji Epsilon](https://www.squareyards.com/mumbai-residential-property/shapoorji-pallonji-epsilon/7398/project \"Shapoorji Pallonji Epsilon\") | ₹ 34,750 |\n| [Shapoorji Pallonji Astron](https://www.squareyards.com/mumbai-residential-property/shapoorji-pallonji-astron/8730/project \"Shapoorji Pallonji Astron\") | ₹ 31,400 |\n| Borivali West | ₹ 30,900 |\n| Current Project **Vas Pushp Vinod 2** | ₹ 29,500 |\n| [Shapoorji Pallonji Sarova](https://www.squareyards.com/mumbai-residential-property/shapoorji-pallonji-sarova/10427/project \"Shapoorji Pallonji Sarova\") | ₹ 26,250 |\n\n### Rentals\n\nMonthly Rent in Vas Pushp Vinod 2 start from ₹ 89 K with options available for 3 BHK units\n\n| Configuration | In Vas Pushp Vinod 2 | In Borivali West |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| 1 BHK | - | ₹ 32.7 K |\n| 2 BHK | - | ₹ 45.5 K |\n| 3 BHK | ₹ 89 K | ₹ 74.4 K |\n\n### Recent Updates\n\nGet the latest price and market updates for Vas Pushp Vinod 2.\n\n#### Mumbai's Water Stock at 95.97% with Seven Lakes Holding High Levels\n\nMumbai's water stock has reached 95.97%, with seven lakes maintaining high levels. This ensures a stable water supply for the city, though civic authorities continue to monitor reservoir levels and rainfall.\n\nRent in Vas Pushp Vinod 2 ranges from ₹ 38 K to ₹ 89 K with options available for 2 BHK, 3 BHK.\n\nDuring Q2'2026, average property prices for Vas Pushp Vinod 2 moved from ₹ 26,500/sqft to ₹ 29,500/sqft, reflecting a 11.32% rise.\n\n#### MMRDA Presents Surplus Budget with Significant Allocation for Infrastructure\n\nMMRDA has presented a surplus budget of ₹48,072 crore, with 87% allocated to infrastructure projects, including roads, public transport, and urban development. A notable provision of ₹4,000 crore is earmarked for the development of Mumbai 3.0 New Town, aiming for planned urban expansion.\n\n#### BMC Budget Includes ₹6,475 Crore for Water Security Projects\n\nThe BMC's FY26-27 budget includes a substantial allocation of ₹6,475 crore for water security initiatives. This funding is designated for projects such as the Manori desalination plant (₹500 crore) and the Gargai project (₹437.51 crore), aimed at augmenting the city's water supply capacity.\n\n#### Mumbai-Pune Expressway 'Missing Link' Project Set for May 1 Inauguration, Promising Safer and Faster Travel\n\nThe highly anticipated 'Missing Link' project on the Mumbai-Pune Expressway is set to be inaugurated on May 1, significantly reducing travel time by approximately 30 minutes and enhancing safety. The 10.5-km stretch features tunnels and a bridge, bypassing the accident-prone Khandala Ghat. This infrastructure upgrade is expected to ease traffic congestion, improve travel safety.\n\n## Vas Pushp Vinod 2 Floor Plans\n\n![Representative image for Floor plan of 1 BHK 417 Sq. Ft. Apartment in Vas Pushp Vinod 2, Mumbai](/assets/images/floor-plans-coming-soon.svg)\n\nPrice:Price on Request\n\n![Representative image for Floor plan of 2 BHK 790 Sq. Ft. Apartment in Vas Pushp Vinod 2, Mumbai](/assets/images/floor-plans-coming-soon.svg)\n\nPrice:Price on Request\n\n## Resale Listings in Vas Pushp Vinod 2\n\nExplore resale listings currently available in Vas Pushp Vinod 2, Mumbai.\n\n![1 BHK Apartment For Sale in Vas Pushp Vinod 2 in Borivali West, Mumbai]()\n\nBorivali West, Mumbai\n\n![2 BHK Apartment For Sale in Vas Pushp Vinod 2 in Borivali West, Mumbai]()\n\nBorivali West, Mumbai\n\n![2 BHK Apartment For Sale in Vas Pushp Vinod 2 in Borivali West, Mumbai]()\n\nBorivali West, Mumbai\n\n![2 BHK Apartment For Sale in Vas Pushp Vinod 2 in Borivali West, Mumbai]()\n\nBorivali West, Mumbai\n\n![2 BHK Apartment For Sale in Vas Pushp Vinod 2 in Borivali West, Mumbai]()\n\nBorivali West, Mumbai\n\n![Smita Shah]()\n\nEst8 Lab\n\nThane\n\n## Amenities & Specifications of Vas Pushp Vinod 2\n\n### Sports Sports\n\n![Sports](https://static.squareyards.com/assets/images/svg/amenities/sports/am-ico-kidsplay-active.svg)\n\n### Convenience Convenience\n\n![Convenience](https://static.squareyards.com/assets/images/svg/amenities/convenience/am-ico-powerbac-active.svg)\n\n### Safety Safety\n\n![Safety](https://static.squareyards.com/assets/images/svg/amenities/safety/am-ico-24x7secu-active.svg)\n\n### Environment Environment\n\n![Environment](https://static.squareyards.com/assets/images/svg/amenities/environment/am-ico-normalpa-active.svg)\n\n### Leisure Leisure\n\n![Leisure](https://static.squareyards.com/assets/images/svg/amenities/leisure/am-ico-indoorga-active.svg)\n\n### Specifications\n\n## Location and Connectivity Around Vas Infrastructures Borivali West\n\n![Connectivity map showing nearby places around Mumbai Western Suburbs](/assets/images/project-map.png?aio=w-714;h-317;crop;)\n\nEstimate commute from your office or kid's school to Vas Pushp Vinod 2.\n\n![Car travel mode](/assets/images/car-fill.svg)\n![Vas Pushp Vinod 2](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/project-image/vas-pushp-vinod-2-project-project-large-image1.jpg?aio=w-112;h-96;crop;)\n\nPlease select the starting point to calculate the travel time.\n\n![Rolling loader icon](/assets/images/rolling-loader.gif)\n\n### Nearby Landmarks\n\n#### Gokhale Education Society Shishu Vikas Mandir\n\n#### Ganesh Mandir Kastur Park\n\n#### Vibha Care Home - The Family Hospital\n\n### Connecting Roads\n\nAverage Asking Price in Borivali West\n\nBased on active listings and recent trends\n\nWestern Express Highway & SV Road\n\nLimited social amenities and infrastructure\n\nBorivali West attracts me since my experiences feel subdued and balanced. Nearby markets daily and excellent schools are good. Weekend beach time and runs close to SGNP are something I like. Andheri and Goregaon are simple for me to work in. Parking problems and traffic jams call for quick solutions.\n\n— Suresh Sanghvi, Tenant\n\n## RERA Details of Vas Pushp Vinod 2\n\n## How does Vas Pushp Vinod 2 compare with similar projects?\n\n![Vas Pushp Vinod 2 project in Borivali West, Mumbai](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/tn-projectflagship/tn-vas-pushp-vinod-2-project-flagship1.jpg?aio=w-229;h-150;crop;)\n\n### [Vas Pushp Vinod 2](https://www.squareyards.