ir pockets too. Since Vas came to life, it has been living to its raison detre by fulfilling dreams of a better lifestyle with its economical modern residential complexes. Motivated by desire to serve the humanity, the company is growing from strength to strength with each new project. A BSE listed company, Vas has earned its target among investors by sheer performance. Today, its capital value stands at INR 250 crore and is poised to grow further\n\n![Vas Pushp Vinod 5 residential project in Borivali West](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/tn-projectflagship/tn-vas-pushp-vinod-5-project-flagship1.jpg?aio=w-230;h-145;crop;)\n\nBorivali West, Mumbai\n\n1, 2 BHK Apartment\n\nPrice On Request\n\n![Vas Pushp Vinod 6 residential project in Borivali West](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/tn-projectflagship/tn-vas-pushp-vinod-6-project-flagship1.jpg?aio=w-230;h-145;crop;)\n\nBorivali West, Mumbai\n\nPrice On Request\n\n![Vas Pushpa Park residential project in Borivali West](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/tn-projectflagship/tn-vas-pushpa-park-project-flagship.jpg?aio=w-230;h-145;crop;)\n\nBorivali West, Mumbai\n\n1, 2, 3, 5, 6 BHK Studio, Apartment\n\n₹ 95.68 Lac to 4.87 Cr\n\n![Vas Pushp Vinod 3 residential project in Borivali West](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/tn-projectflagship/tn-vas-pushp-vinod-3-project-flagship1.jpg?aio=w-230;h-145;crop;)\n\nBorivali West, Mumbai\n\n1, 2, 3 BHK Apartment, Studio\n\n₹ 60.50 Lac to 2.48 Cr\n\n![VAS Pushp Vinod 4 residential project in Borivali West](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/tn-projectflagship/tn-vas-pushp-vinod-4-project-flagship1.jpg?aio=w-230;h-145;crop;)\n\nBorivali West, Mumbai\n\n1, 2 BHK Apartment\n\n₹ 1.18 Cr to 2.05 Cr\n\n![VAS Pushp Vinod 15 residential project in Borivali West](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/tn-projectflagship/tn-vas-pushp-vinod-15-flagship2.jpg?aio=w-230;h-145;cro